 <title>Make your Drupal sites fly with Varnish Cache</title>
 <link>http://2011.drupalcamp.es/en/sessions/make-your-drupal-sites-fly-varnish-cache</link>
 <description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://varnish-cache.org/&quot;&gt;Varnish Cache&lt;/a&gt; has rapidly grown to be the de facto Reverse Proxy Cache package of choice. In this presentation I will explain the basics of Varnish, describe how I use it on a daily basis at my employer &lt;a href=&quot;http://kpn.com/&quot;&gt;KPN&lt;/a&gt;, the largest Telco and IT firm in the Netherlands and how you can use it to dramatically increase overall performance of your Drupal site. &lt;/p&gt;
